Source: cta
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: CTA Team <cta-support@cern.ch>
Build-Depends: @BUILD_REQUIREMENTS@
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://cta.web.cern.ch
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: cta
Section: metapackages
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, cta-taped (= ${binary:Version}), cta-maintd (= ${binary:Version}), cta-frontend-grpc (= ${binary:Version}), cta-rmcd (= ${binary:Version}), cta-tools (= ${binary:Version})
Description: CERN Tape Archive services and tools
 Convenience package installing all CTA services and administrative tools.

Package: cta-runtime
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Description: CERN Tape Archive shared runtime data
 Provides the CTA system account, shared configuration examples
 and logging schema.

Package: libcta@CTA_SOVERSION@
Section: libs
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, opentelemetry-cpp (@OPENTELEMETRY_CPP_VERSION_CONSTRAINT@)
Description: CERN Tape Archive runtime libraries
 Provides shared libraries and PostgreSQL and SQLite plugins used by CTA.

Package: libcta-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libcta@CTA_SOVERSION@ (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Development files for CERN Tape Archive libraries
 Provides unversioned linker names for developing against CTA libraries.

Package: cta-taped
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cta-runtime (= ${binary:Version}), libcta@CTA_SOVERSION@ (= ${binary:Version})
Recommends: systemd, logrotate
Description: CERN Tape Archive tape daemon
 Provides the tape daemon and its service configuration.

Package: cta-maintd
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cta-runtime (= ${binary:Version}), libcta@CTA_SOVERSION@ (= ${binary:Version})
Recommends: systemd, logrotate
Description: CERN Tape Archive maintenance daemon
 Provides the maintenance daemon and its service configuration.

Package: cta-frontend-grpc
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cta-runtime (= ${binary:Version}), libcta@CTA_SOVERSION@ (= ${binary:Version})
Recommends: systemd, logrotate
Description: CERN Tape Archive gRPC frontend
 Provides the gRPC frontend and its service configuration.

Package: cta-rmcd
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cta-runtime (= ${binary:Version}), libcta@CTA_SOVERSION@ (= ${binary:Version})
Recommends: systemd, logrotate
Description: CERN Tape Archive remote media changer daemon
 Provides the remote media changer daemon and its service configuration.

Package: cta-tools
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cta-runtime (= ${binary:Version}), libcta@CTA_SOVERSION@ (= ${binary:Version}), libcap2-bin, xrootd-client
Description: CERN Tape Archive administrative tools
 Provides administration, database schema, tape and EOS tools
 with their manuals.

Package: cta-test-external-tape-formats
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libcta@CTA_SOVERSION@ (= ${binary:Version})
Description: CERN Tape Archive external tape format tests
 Provides tools for reading test tapes written in OSM and Enstore formats.

Package: cta-tests
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.cta.notests>
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cta-taped (= ${binary:Version}), libcta@CTA_SOVERSION@ (= ${binary:Version}), valgrind, postgresql, moreutils, make, libgtest-dev, libtirpc-dev
Description: CERN Tape Archive unit and integration tests
 Provides test runners, test libraries and dynamic-analysis support files.
